        "kind": "teach",
        "title": "statement + 呢",
        "blocks": [
          {
            "text": "Sentence-final 呢 can emphasize a continuing situation or remind someone of a relevant fact. It need not ask a question.",
            "examples": [
              {
                "text": "他在学习呢。",
                "pinyin": "tā zài xuéxí ne 。",
                "meaning": "He is studying, you know.",
                "audio": "89bbf2e0a446847ee5e64c9d0f0dff4f38998603772bf912c897cdeb93c19826"
              },
              {
                "text": "时间还早呢。",
                "pinyin": "shíjiān hái zǎo ne 。",
                "meaning": "It is still early, you know.",
                "audio": "8e7dcdf25f9509a026183afb4519ff80f176f1d4c128247c01ab79cda5b52743"
              }
